# Attachment drop directory.
#
# Writable by the FieldOps application pool identity at runtime -- that ACL is
# what makes the upload flaw exploitable. Granted by Provision-FieldOps.ps1;
# do not tighten it here.
#
# Deliberately has NO web.config of its own: inheriting the parent's handler
# mappings is what lets an uploaded .AspX execute.
